; HomerView.jkm -- HomerView's keys, for reference
;
; NOT WHAT BINDS THEM. JAWS loads an application key map named after the
; executable, and nothing on this machine is called HomerView.exe, so this file
; is never read. The bindings are written into the user's own default.jkm by
; chainJawsScripts, which copies the factory file first and adds to it. This
; copy is kept so the keys have one readable home in the project.
;
; SECTIONS MATTER MORE THAN KEYS HERE.
;
; [Common Keys] applies everywhere, in every application and every cursor mode.
; Only commands that must work before HomerView is running belong there, plus
; the few that are about HomerView itself rather than about a page.
;
; [Virtual Keys] applies while the VIRTUAL CURSOR is active, which for a web
; page is most of the time. It is NOT the same as "while Edge is in front": in
; the address bar or a form field these do not fire, and the key reaches the
; browser instead.
;
; Scoping a command to the BROWSER -- every cursor mode, Edge only -- needs
; more than an msedge.jkm: HomerView's scripts have to be CHAINED INTO EDGE'S
; OWN SCRIPT SET, because Edge already has JAWS scripts and a key map naming
; our commands cannot resolve them otherwise. That work is described in
; chainJawsScripts and is not done yet.

[Common Keys]
Alt+JAWSKey+A=checkAccessibility
Alt+JAWSKey+C=findContacts
Alt+JAWSKey+D=dismissDialog
Alt+JAWSKey+F10=showHomerViewMenu
Alt+JAWSKey+H=launchHomerView
Alt+JAWSKey+I=checkAccessibilityIbm
Alt+JAWSKey+L=copyLogToClipboard
Alt+Shift+H=showHotkeySummary

[Virtual Keys]
Alt+Apostrophe=sayClipboard
Alt+C=copyAppend
Alt+Control+F1=openSessionLog
Alt+F1=showAbout
Alt+F8=readAll
Alt+L=describeLinkTarget
Alt+M=sayMetadata
Alt+N=listNames
Alt+Shift+Apostrophe=clearClipboard
Alt+Shift+F1=openQuickStart
Alt+Shift+P=copyPageLinks
Alt+Shift+F=openPageFolder
Alt+Shift+W=downloadFiles
Control+Apostrophe=saveClipboard
Control+C=copySelection
Control+F1=openUserGuide
Control+F3=findByPattern
Control+F8=copyAll
Control+O=openDocument
Control+S=savePage
Control+Shift+Apostrophe=appendClipboard
Control+Shift+E=extractByPattern
Control+Shift+F1=openDeveloperNotes
Control+Shift+F3=findByPatternBackwards
Control+Shift+F=findBackwards
F3=findNext
F8=startSelection
Shift+F1=showHistory
Shift+F3=findPrevious
Shift+F4=sayTabNames
Shift+F8=completeSelection
Shift+F9=extractMainContent
Shift+Q=moveToProbableMain
